╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝`}</pre>
        <span class="sr-only">{name}</span>
        <p class="terminal-about__role">
          <span class="text-cyan">{role}</span> <span class="text-amber">@</span> <span class="text-green">{company}</span>
        </p>
